. She assumes it's nothing but bad news, but it turns out Prince Fernand himself invited her, and the reason is even worse than she thought...","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-10-22","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7.2,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gTGsnDkq4lJjXe2tw72DtfEUYl6.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gTGsnDkq4lJjXe2tw72DtfEUYl6.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/221148/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"4725295","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Kaoru starts a secret organization called \"Eyes of the Goddess\" to find and help people in need, earning herself the reputation of an angel. Rumors of an angel in the city quickly draw the attention of the royal family and the temple...","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-10-29","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7nA5sWAetdcCIp7WiyV5IutSTY8.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7nA5sWAetdcCIp7WiyV5IutSTY8.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/221148/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"4725296","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Kaoru decides to team up with some powerful people she can trust to help her share the benefits of her potions with even more people. But just as her new business is underway, an unexpected visitor comes looking for her...","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-11-05","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7.2,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tPr4EgkirCTWTgztOAIT3YRtA5E.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tPr4EgkirCTWTgztOAIT3YRtA5E.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/221148/season/1/episode/5"},{"id":"4725297",